13. Small algorithms in the public domain (no notice required)
===============================================================================

  src/render/solar.rs, src/story/script.rs
      Howard Hinnant's days_from_civil (public domain).
  src/census/ramp.rs, src/tile_source/cog/mod.rs
      matplotlib's viridis colour map stops (CC0).
  src/projection.rs, src/render/shader.wgsl (project_to_flat)
      Equal Earth: the published formulas and coefficients of Savric,
      Patterson & Jenny (2018), IJGIS 33(3). Robinson: the 5-degree table
      published by Robinson (1974) and Snyder (1990), as tabulated in PROJ
      (src/projections/robin.cpp, MIT, Copyright (c) the PROJ authors).
      The flat-projection design follows MapLibre GL JS 6.15's custom CRS
      (section 1): the round-trip check and edge bisection of
      CRSWorldCoordinateHelper.

